#: forms.py:15
msgid "Character Audit: sections that count"
msgstr "Character-Audit: Abschnitte, die zählen"

#: forms.py:16
msgid ""
"A character is inactive when one of these has not updated within corptools' "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"Ein Character gilt als inaktiv, wenn einer davon nicht innerhalb der "
"corptools-Frist aktualisiert wurde."

#: forms.py:22
msgid "Character Audit: required scopes"
msgstr "Character-Audit: benötigte Scopes"

#: forms.py:23
msgid "A character's token must carry all of these."
msgstr "Der Token eines Characters muss alle diese tragen."

#: forms.py:29
msgid "Corporation Audit: sections that count"
msgstr "Corporation-Audit: Abschnitte, die zählen"

#: forms.py:30
msgid ""
"A Corporation's data is stale when one of these has not updated within the "
"limit above."
msgstr ""
"Die Daten einer Corporation gelten als veraltet, wenn einer davon nicht "
"innerhalb der obigen Frist aktualisiert wurde."

#: forms.py:36
msgid "Corporation Audit: required scopes"
msgstr "Corporation-Audit: benötigte Scopes"

#: forms.py:37
msgid "One token of a Corporation member must carry all of these."
msgstr "Ein Token eines Corporation-Mitglieds muss alle diese tragen."

#: forms.py:57 models.py:32 templates/eos_auth_monitor/account.html:42
#: templates/eos_auth_monitor/settings.html:11
msgctxt "EVE jargon"
msgid "Alliance"
msgstr "Alliance"

#: models.py:33
msgid "The Alliance whose accounts and Corporations are monitored."
msgstr "Die Alliance, deren Accounts und Corporations überwacht werden."

#: models.py:40
msgid "Stale after (days)"
msgstr "Veraltet nach (Tagen)"

#: models.py:42
msgid ""
"Days after which a section of the corptools Corporation audit counts as "
"stale. Empty: the same limit corptools uses for characters."
msgstr ""
"Tage, nach denen ein Abschnitt des corptools-Corporation-Audits als veraltet"
" gilt. Leer: dieselbe Frist, die corptools für Characters verwendet."

#: models.py:58
msgid "Fetch member lists from ESI"
msgstr "Mitgliederlisten von ESI abrufen"

#: models.py:60
msgid ""
"Reads each Corporation's member list with a token corptools already has, to "
"show members that are not registered in Auth."
msgstr ""
"Liest die Mitgliederliste jeder Corporation mit einem Token, den corptools "
"bereits hat, um Mitglieder zu zeigen, die nicht in Auth registriert sind."

#: models.py:67 models.py:70
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration"

#: models.py:102
msgid "Pass accounts that HAVE problems instead of those without."
msgstr "Accounts durchlassen, die Probleme HABEN, statt solcher ohne."

#: models.py:106
msgid "Also count the problems of the Corporation of the main."
msgstr "Auch die Probleme der Corporation des Mains zählen."

#: models.py:110
msgid "Smart Filter: Auth Monitor problems"
msgstr "Smart Filter: Auth-Monitor-Probleme"

